OL,3,GNEWSACouple fear company could fold
OL,4,Aafter flooded canal repairs still not
OL,5,Amade
OL,6,
OL,7,FA husband and wife have warned their
OL,8,Fcompany supplying fuel to boats will
OL,9,Fsoon be "unsustainable" because of the
OL,10,Ftime it's taking to fix a collapsed
OL,11,Fembankment which has blocked England's
OL,12,Foldest canal.
OL,14,FThe Bridgewater Canal in Cheshire burst
OL,15,Fits banks during heavy rain on New
OL,16,FYear's Day 2025 near the village of
OL,17,FLittle Bollington in Cheshire.
OL,19,FBut building work to repair the breach
OL,20,Fstill has not begun and boat owners,
OL,21,Fnearby residents and businesses have
OL,22,Fcriticised the time it's taken.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
